From 5bd5de4de1bb6b70f846e67b937a3ad5a7e8f0e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adhi <adhi@shinecraft.dev>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 08:50:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Redesign Company Invoice to match approved GST Tax
 Invoice reference layout

- Added Service Type, Billing Period (From/To), and Place of Supply fields to the Invoice
  entity, InvoiceFormValues, mock seed data, and the Create/Edit Invoice form so these can
  be captured per invoice.
- Rebuilt CompanyInvoice.tsx to match the approved reference: logo + Invoice No/Date/Due
  Date/Place of Supply meta box header, centered TAX INVOICE title, dark-header BILL TO box,
  a 3-column Project Details / Billing Information / Service Details strip, SI No/Service
  Description/SAC-HSN/Qty/Rate/Amount items table, a dark-header Service Payment Summary box
  (Service Value, Amount Received Till Date, Current Invoice Amount, Total After This
  Payment, Outstanding Balance) alongside a Taxable Amount/CGST/SGST/Invoice Total box +
  Amount in Words, Bank Details + bulleted Notes, a separate Terms & Conditions section, and
  a stamp + 'For Shine Craft Technologies' authorised-signatory block.
- Wired the fallback synthetic invoice built in PaymentsReceivedListPage with the new
  required fields so the Payments \u2192 View Invoice preview still type-checks and renders.
